# Tests create scratch stores here at runtime and remove them on success; keep
# the directory tracked but ignore everything written into it.
#
# Checked-in fixtures must be un-ignored BY NAME. A fixture a test names as its
# `source:` is not scratch output — if it is ignored it still passes locally,
# where the file is on disk, and silently stops testing anything on a fresh
# clone.
*
!.gitignore
!malformed-key.yaml
!non-store.yaml
!shared-root-writer.yaml
!shared-root-reader.yaml
